 "text": "Home | Hocking County\nSkip to main content\nAn official website of Hocking County government departments\nHere's how you know\nHere's how you know\nOfficial websites use .gov\nA .gov website belongs to an official government organization in Hocking County.\nSecure .gov websites use HTTPS\nA lock (\n) or https:// means you’ve safely connected to the .gov website. Share sensitive information only on official, secure websites.\nHome\nCounty Offices\nGeneral\nAuditor\nCommissioners\nIT Department\nMap Department\nRecorder\nTreasurer\nRegional Planning\nLodging Tax\nSewer Department\nExtended\nBoard of DD\nBoard of Elections\nEngineer\nFamily First Council\nHealth Department\nLand Bank\nScenic Hills Senior Center\nSoil and Water\nVeterans\nEmergency Services\n911\nEMA\nEMS\nSheriff\nCoroner\nCourts\nClerk of Courts\nCommon Pleas\nJuvenile/Probate Court\nMunicipal Court\nProsecutor\nOther Offices\nCity of Logan\nFair Housing\nHocking Valley Community Hospital\nLogan-Hocking Schools\nOfficials\nElected Officials\nAuditor - Christopher Robers\nClerk of Courts - Rhonda Wykle\nCommissioner - Andrew Davidson\nCommissioner - Jason D'Onofrio\nCommissioner - Michael Linton\nCommon Pleas - Jason Despetorich\nCoroner - David Cummin\nEngineer - Bill Shaw\nJuvenile/Probate Court - Jonah Saving\nMunicipal Court - Fred Moses\nProsecutor - Jennifer Graham\nRecorder - Teresa Salizzoni\nSheriff - Lanny North\nTreasurer - Blaine Davidson\nAppointed Officials\n911 - Sandy Wintermute\nBoard of DD - Jill Squires\nBoard of Elections - Lisa Schwartze\nEMA Director - Mark Edgar\nHealth Department - Doug Fisher\nHelp Me Grow - Margret Demko\nIT Director - Mark Stout\nSenior Center - Margie Moore\nVeterans - Vicki Rafferty\nPay Tax\nOnline Search Systems\nServices\nReal Estate/Mobile Home\nDog Tags\nRecorder Record Search\nSheriff Sales\nCourts\nCommon Pleas\nJuvenile/Probate Court\nMunicipal Docket\nMunicipal Records\nLaw Library\nContact Us\nBlaine Davidson\nTreasurer\n(740) 385-3517\nHome\nMake a Payment\nServices & Resources\nMortgage Escrow Payment Tracking\nChange of Address\nCollection Dates\nTax Rates\nDelinquent Taxes\nBudget Payment Plan\nHow it works\nReducing your taxes\nFrequent Questions\nForms\nContact Us\nUnclaimed Funds\nHocking County Treasurer's Office\nDue to recent legislation changes the 2nd half tax collection due date has been extended to August 7th 2026 for both Real Estate and Mobile Home. The tax bills mailed out as soon as possible prior to that date.\nShould you have questions or require additional information please do not hesitate to contact our office at (740)385-3517 or email me at treasurersoffice@hocking.oh.gov .\nThank you,\nBlaine K. Davidson\nHocking County Treasurer\nHocking County Treasurer's Office\nHocking County Courthouse\n1 E. Main St, Suite 201\nLogan, Ohio 43138\nPhone: (740) 385-3517\nFax: (740) 385-8236\nE-mail: treasurersoffice@hocking.oh.gov\nReturn to top\n| Hocking County\nLogan, OH 43138 Courthouse\n1 East Main Street\nAnnex\n93 West Hunter Street\nHall of Justice\n105 West Hunter Street\nMore Addresses...\n| Phone Numbers Commissioners - (740) 385-5195\nAuditor - (740) 385-2127\nTreasurer - (740) 385-3517\nSheriff - (740) 385-2131\nElections - (740) 380-8683\nMore Numbers...\n| Popular Links Real Estate\nDog Tags\nCounty Maps\nPay Sewer Bill\nPay Real Estate\n| Site Information Accessibility\nCopyright\nEqual Opportunity\nContact Us\n|",
